{"unit_id":"YUANMINGXUE__dsh-search#card-zh","repo":"YUANMINGXUE/dsh-search","commit":"acb4e69cea3ead48e3d516ace06f41798879503a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-browser-search 是面向 DSH agent 的本地浏览器网页搜索与页面读取插件，可通过 Bing、DuckDuckGo 或 Google 查询并提取标题、链接和摘要，也能读取指定网页渲染后的正文。它在 DSH 工具集中注册 browser_search 与 browser_fetch，使用已安装的 Chromium 系浏览器和 Chrome DevTools Protocol 完成导航与内容提取。适合需要联网查资料、查看 JavaScript 渲染页面且不使用搜索 API 密钥的场景；需要本机安装兼容浏览器，并可选择配置搜索引擎。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:55-76","lib/index.js:165-181","lib/driver.js:361-385","lib/driver.js:406-424"]}
{"unit_id":"YUANMINGXUE__dsh-search#card-en","repo":"YUANMINGXUE/dsh-search","commit":"acb4e69cea3ead48e3d516ace06f41798879503a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-local-browser-search adds web search and rendered-page reading to DSH through browser_search and browser_fetch. It uses an installed Chromium-based browser to search Bing, DuckDuckGo, or Google and extract page text. A local compatible browser is required; no search API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:55-76","lib/index.js:165-181","lib/driver.js:361-385","lib/driver.js:406-424"]}
